          "type": "step",
          "id": "cathunt:129qgqz",
          "html": "Speak to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hild</a> in the building north of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Heroes%27_Guild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Heroes&#39; Guild</a>. She will enchant the catspeak amulet for 5 death runes.",
          "text": "Speak to Hild in the building north of the Heroes' Guild. She will enchant the catspeak amulet for 5 death runes.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "cathunt:6oypi",
          "html": "Locate <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bob_the_Cat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bob the Cat</a> using the catspeak amulet.",
          "text": "Locate Bob the Cat using the catspeak amulet.",
