              "text": "Click on the whiskers until the arrow and the eyes glow white.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cathunt:6oypi:8tz7zf",
              "html": "Run in the direction of the arrow, occasionally re-checking the amulet, until you find Bob.",
              "text": "Run in the direction of the arrow, occasionally re-checking the amulet, until you find Bob.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cathunt:6oypi:16kjryl",
              "html": "The easiest way to find Bob is to keep hopping worlds in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Carwen_Essencebinder_Magical_Runes_Shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Carwen Essencebinder Magical Runes Shop</a> in Burthorpe.",
